16	//     aggregator and each event counts in full in every window containing it
17	//     (the value is never split, and this is not just relabeled start/end);
18	//   - a non-dividing interval is legal and produces a distinct result grid;
19	//   - an explicitly given zero is rejected (exit 2) even though an omitted
20	//     flag defaults to fixed windows, along with negative, oversized and
